index 0000000..c36be88
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/features/09_tasks.md
@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
+# Feature: Tasks (consult / execute)
+
+## Purpose
+Policy-gated work items where the AI Employee may use tools. Separate from advisory chat.
+
+## Modes
+| Mode | Behavior |
+|------|----------|
+| **Consult** | Plan / analysis only (safer) |
+| **Execute** | Tools run; may create approval requests |
+
+## Who
+- Create: `task.create` (Owner, AI Admin, Manager, Reservation, Member, …)
+- Read list: `task.read`
+- Run consult/execute: same company + agent access
+
+## Frontend
+- **Tasks** — create form (hidden without `task.create`) + task center with Consult / Execute actions
+- Linked from Chat “Also create Task”
+
+## Backend
+- `POST /companies/{id}/tasks`
+- `POST /companies/{id}/tasks/{id}/consult`
+- `POST /companies/{id}/tasks/{id}/execute`
diff --git a/docs/features/10_approvals.md b/docs/features/10_approvals.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..128bb23
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/features/10_approvals.md
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+# Feature: Approvals
+
+## Purpose
+Human gate for restricted tool actions (e.g. create_reservation). Approve continues the task; reject stops it.
+
+## Who
+- View: `approval.read`
+- Approve/Reject: `approval.manage` (Owner, Manager typically)
+- Other roles see pending items as read-only “waiting for manager”
+
+## Frontend
+- **Approvals** nav + Inbox badges
+- Approve / Reject buttons only with `approval.manage`
+
+## Backend
+- `GET /companies/{id}/approvals`
+- `POST /companies/{id}/approvals/{id}/approve`
+- `POST /companies/{id}/approvals/{id}/reject`
